  dialogues:
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "What is this bullshit! How\u2019s anyone supposed to walk here!"
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "At least with these sub-zero degrees, we don\u2019t have to deal with the
      smell."
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    Popup: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    sentences:
    - "Ah yes, thank god that we have to freeze to death each and everyday, just
      so we don\u2019t have to worry about some smells."
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
